# Git author

Every commit is by Ziaur Rahman `<programmerzia@gmail.com>`. GitHub treats a `Co-authored-by` trailer as another contributor.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by`, `Signed-off-by`, or any trailer that names a person, bot, or tool.
- Do not set Claude, Cursor, CommandCode, or any other assistant as author, committer, or co-author.
- Do not add "Generated by" or other assistant attribution lines.
- Do not change git config. The commit hook drops `Co-authored-by` lines if a tool inserts them.

```text
# Bad
Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

# Good
feat(invoices): post a balanced sales journal
```
